# Trivy findings accepted for the ns3-dev images, each with its reason
# (ns3-containers#38). Only the security stage's Dockerfile scan reads this;
# the vulnerability and secret scans take no exceptions.

# DS-0002 (HIGH) "no non-root USER": deliberate. The images are build
# environments, not services: ns3-build-contrib links modules into and
# rebuilds /opt/ns-3, and CI runs them as GitHub Actions `container:` jobs,
# which expect root. Users who want a non-root container pass `--user`.
DS-0002
